    "q-181780": {
      "dom_id": "step-q181780",
      "name": "Question 2",
      "problem": "Which of the following is a representation of the set $S={R}^{+}\\times Z$ in the Cartesian plane?",
      "worked_solution": "The Cartesian product $A\\times B$ consists of all ordered pairs whose first coordinate belongs to $A$ and whose second coordinate belongs to $B.$\n\n$$\nA\\times B=\\{(a,b)\\,:\\,a\\in A,\\,b\\in B\\}\n$$\n\nIn this case, the set \n\n$$\nS={R}^{+}\\times Z\n$$\n\n \ncontains every point in ${R}^{2}$ whose $x$-coordinate is a positive real number and whose $y$-coordinate is an integer number.\n\n$$\nS=\\{(x,y)\\,:\\,x\\in {R}^{+},\\,y\\in Z\\}\n$$\n\nTo visualize $S,$ consider ${S}_{-1}⊂S$ containing all points whose $x$-coordinate is any positive real number and whose $y$-coordinate equals $-1.$\n\n$$\n{S}_{-1}=\\{(x,-1)\\,:\\,x\\in {R}^{+}\\}\n$$\n\nWe can represent ${S}_{-1}$ in the plane as follows:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14249122/assets/50228bcff5b3678518379cda03257ac234e8312cd23f9b38fa897188c8c5c1c5.png)\n\nNext, consider ${S}_{1}⊂S$ containing all points whose $x$-coordinate is any positive real number and whose $y$-coordinate equals $1.$\n\n$$\n{S}_{1}=\\{(x,1)\\,:\\,x\\in {R}^{+}\\}.\n$$\n\nWe can represent ${S}_{1}$ in the plane as follows:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14249122/assets/75f8be8dd49241503b705c78e4018a98fead197191b38f856d7fbce069a63de2.png)\n\nWe can create the subsets $…,{S}_{-3},{S}_{-2},{S}_{0},{S}_{2},{S}_{3},…$ similarly. Our Cartesian product consists of the *union* of these subsets:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{R}^{+}\\times Z & =…{S}_{-2}\\cup {S}_{-1}\\cup {S}_{0}\\cup {S}_{1}\\cup {S}_{2}\\cup {S}_{3}\\cup … \\\\  & ={⋃}_{i\\in Z}{S}_{i}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we can visualize ${R}^{+}\\times Z$ as the set of horizontal lines shown in the diagram below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14249122/assets/2086bcf65608ff2c031da9f6882272fd6d8eb828f3d904c4f0fc946b5fbe108c.png)",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
