><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D456 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2208\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-ds mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2124 TEX-A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom></mjx-texatom></mjx-under></mjx-row></mjx-munder><mjx-msub space=\"2\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D446 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em; margin-left: -0.032em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D456 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd></mjx-mtr></mjx-itable></mjx-table></mjx-mtable></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mtable displaystyle=\"true\" columnalign=\"right left\" columnspacing=\"0em\" rowspacing=\"0.8em 0.3em\"><mtr><mtd><mi>S</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo>…</mo><mo>∪</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>∪</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>∪</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>∪</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>∪</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>∪</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>∪</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>∪</mo><mo>…</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OP\">⋃</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Z</mi></mrow></mrow></munder><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Therefore, we can visualize <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"99\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; p